msgid "A polkit rule is written that authorises your user, in the active local session, to start \"ryzenctl serve\" without a password: it only covers Ryzen Control, it is not a generic sudo. In exchange, any program run as your user will be able to change limits, Curve Optimizer and fans without asking you anything (always within the ryzenctl ceilings). It can be disabled from here at any time."
